    <data key="d0">Global DataNet - Construction Site Image Obfuscation Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture ingests construction site images via SFTP to S3, processes them instantly and in batch using Lambda and Amazon Rekognition to blur sensitive data, and delivers results via S3.</data>
